{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"removeCoordinatesInRange:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@_NSRange","text":"NSRange","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"range","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The range of vertices to remove. The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"location"},{"type":"text","text":" field indicates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the first vertex you are removing, with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"type":"text","text":" being the first vertex, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"being the second vertex, and so on. The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"length"},{"type":"text","text":" field indicates the number"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of vertices to remove."}]}],"name":"range"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the shape is currently visible on the map as an annotation, it is redrawn"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"immediately. If the shape is part of an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"},{"type":"text","text":" object, you must"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"explicitly set the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/shape"},{"type":"text","text":" property in order for any style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layers that use the source to be redrawn."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"range"},{"type":"text","text":" extends beyond the shape’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coordinates"},{"type":"text","text":" property, an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSRangeException"},{"type":"text","text":" is raised."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Removes the vertices at the given range from the shape.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipoint\/removecoordinatesinrange:"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint\/removeCoordinatesInRange:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"removeCoordinatesInRange:","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"removeCoordinatesInRange:"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"removeCoordinatesInRange:","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNMultiPoint(im)removeCoordinatesInRange:","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}]},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource/shape":{"title":"shape","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"shape","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource\/shape","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The contents of the source. A shape can represent a GeoJSON geometry, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"feature, or a collection of features."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/shape","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMultiPoint":{"abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" class is an abstract superclass used to define shapes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"composed of multiple vertices.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"MLNMultiPoint","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MLNMultiPoint","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipoint","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShape":{"abstract":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},{"type":"text","text":" is an abstract class that represents a shape or annotation. Shapes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"constitute the content of a map — not only the overlays atop the map, but also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the content that forms the base map."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShape"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MLNShape","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshape","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","title":"MapLibre","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The proxy object for the current map style."}],"fragments":[{"text":"MLNStyle","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MLNStyle","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMultiPoint/removeCoordinatesInRange:":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Removes the vertices at the given range from the shape."}],"fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"removeCoordinatesInRange:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"removeCoordinatesInRange:","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipoint\/removecoordinatesinrange:","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint\/removeCoordinatesInRange:"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource":{"title":"MLNShapeSource","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSource","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource","abstract":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a map content source that supplies vector shapes to be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shown on the map. The shapes may be instances of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or they may be defined by local or external"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GeoJSON"},{"type":"text","text":" code. A shape source is added to an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object along with an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object. The vector style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layer defines the appearance of any content supplied by the shape source. You"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can update a shape source by setting its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"shape"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URL"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"}}}